                "message": "Do not create large repeated constant tuples at module init\n\nA literal tuple multiplied by a constant integer became a module-level\nconstant, so (1, 2, 3) * 2**63 or (1,) * 10**15 made the import fail with\nOverflowError or MemoryError, even if the expression was never evaluated.\nOnly keep the repetition as a constant when the result has at most 256\nitems, and evaluate it at runtime otherwise.",
